# Gemini labeling fleet (handoff from chat 0917c4ea)

Source chat: [Gemini labeling pods](0917c4ea-baaa-43c9-b02b-ef6bc5a2e2a7). Do not print or commit tokens.

## What it is

Label `trigger_candidate` gaps (1.5–12s, RMS ≥ −50 dB) from Hub dataset **`aoxo/audios2`** with **Vertex Gemini Batch**. Keep rows stay local jsonl; CLAP train manifest is **`aoxo/clap-ft-data`** (`clap_finetune_manifest.jsonl`). Audio is ephemeral (delete m4a after cuts).

Repo: `/Users/aoxo/vscode/text2asmr`
- Submit/harvest: `scripts/annotate_audios2_gemini_batch.py` (`--stripe-models` round-robins 3.8/3.7/3.6)
- Hub download + CLAP rows: `scripts/annotate_audios2_gemini.py` (rotates `HF_TOKEN` / `HF_TOKEN_B`)
- Manifest: `scripts/build_clap_finetune_manifest.py` + `scripts/sync_clap_ft_manifest.sh`
- Ledgers: `label_tool/gemini_audios2*.jsonl`, `label_tool/clap_train_audios2*.jsonl`

Vertex: project `project-9da5a2fe-3df4-485e-9a9`, location `global`. GCS `gs://aleddo-splitter-eval/t2a-gemini-batch/`. Batch has **no RPM**; capacity is a **shared pool per model id**. Extra IPs/ports do not multiply quota. Unary RPM is a different product.

Live as of 2026-09-14 ~09:55 IST: GCE **`t2a-label`** `n2-highcpu-32` `us-east1-b` IP `35.185.77.101`, stripe 3.8/3.7/3.6, batch 200, 64 workers, inflight 120. ~**1.34M** unique labeled (~20k/h). ~2.75M gaps total. Billed ~$1/hr until **deleted**. RunPod CPUs terminated. DO `root@139.59.33.163` idle (was duplicate full-corpus). Mac poll-only only.

